  "description": "meme-id: girls_reaction_boys_reaction_gorilla_in_a_fuckin_coupe; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The meme juxtaposes a girl's exaggeratedly distressed reaction to being sent out of class with a boy's energetic performance and a third reaction labeled 'gorilla in a fuckin coupe reaction,' which is a derogatory and racist stereotype comparing Black people to primates. This visual and textual combination is intended to mock and demean Black men by associating them with animalistic behavior, which is a harmful and hateful stereotype rooted in anti-Black racism. The meme uses this harmful imagery to perpetuate racial prejudice and reinforce negative racial tropes.",
